'''Chalkboard Eraser Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]] that can be obtained from the [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 652
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Chalkboard Eraser Cat
|name2 = Chalkboard Punk Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Chalkboard Punk Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Chalkboard Eraser Cat is essentially a specialized [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] that is only effective against Red enemies, as its cost and health doesn't allow it to be an effective meatshield against anything else. With considerable grind, reaching level 1+55 with max [[Blood Fruit]]s allows it '''37,500''' effective health against Red, noticeably higher than the other Eraser variants, but it has a measly 7,500 health against non-Red. As such, it's only useful on very Red-heavy stages or {{4c}}, and even then faces competition from other anti-Red meatshields such as [[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Carpenter Cat]], [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Maximum the Fighter]] or [[Ancient Egg: N206 (Special Cat)|Clam Cat]].

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

